Every document classified here is theirs. The 8,617 documents in
`out/classifications.csv` derive from Harvey LAB's
`tasks/firm-knowledge/dms` corpus, and each `documentId` in that file is
derived from a Harvey filename. Nothing in this repository would exist without
that dataset: there is no other freely available corpus of legal documents at
